        },
        {
          "text": "Nabachelela oluchelo lundi, naboola mbu Obwami obwomwikulu bufwana shinga imoni ndala yolufwa Iwelisaatsi eya omundu yabukula nahaanya mumukundakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
