              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nayo toto neinduutu khubufwa bwosi; nebutswa olwa yikhula yiyomba emiani, niyiikhola omusaala, okwa amanyonyi akokhwikulu keetsanga nikeekhala mumasaka kakwo.",
