        },
        {
          "text": "Nababoolela oluchelo lundi, ari Obwami obwomwikulu bufwana shinga amalela, aka omukhasi undi yabukula, natsokasia mubimwelo bitaru biobusie, okhuula bwosi olwa bwafwimba.",
          "type": "text",
