            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwami obwomwikulu bufwana shinga libiikho eliabiswa mumukunda; elia omundu yanyoola, mana nabisa; ne khulwa okhwikhoya natsia nakulaasia ebia yali ninabio biosi amapeesa, nakula omukunda tsana.",
          "type": "text",
